```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer / Harness (Cursor/Claude/Antigravity/Pi)
    participant OAuth as Connector Gateway (OAuth)
    participant LLM_GW as LLM Gateway
    participant ACL as Dual-Plane ACL Engine
    participant Ctrl as Bidirectional Ctrl Bus
    participant CON_GW as Connector Gateway Runtime
    participant ExtLLM as Upstream LLM (Gemini/Claude)
    participant ExtSaaS as External SaaS (Google/Slack)
    participant GitStore as Storage & Git Engine

    Note over Dev,OAuth: 1. Authentication & OAuth Handshake
    Dev->>OAuth: Initiate OAuth (PKCE / Token Exchange)
    OAuth-->>Dev: Issue Session Token & Active Connector Scopes

    Note over Dev,LLM_GW: 2. Harness Prompt & Schema Injection
    Dev->>LLM_GW: POST /v1/chat/completions (Prompt + Session Token)
    LLM_GW->>ACL: Check LLM Policy (Caller, Requested Model)
    alt Model Denied (e.g. ChatGPT blocked)
        ACL-->>LLM_GW: Policy Violation (HTTP 403 Forbidden)
        LLM_GW-->>Dev: 403 Forbidden: Model blocked by organization ACL
    else Model Permitted
        ACL-->>LLM_GW: Permitted
        LLM_GW->>Ctrl: Query Active Tools for Session
        Ctrl->>CON_GW: Fetch permitted MCP/OpenAPI schemas
        CON_GW->>ACL: Validate Connector Policies (Workspace, Slack enabled)
        ACL-->>CON_GW: Connector rules verified
        CON_GW-->>Ctrl: Return Tool Definitions JSON
        Ctrl-->>LLM_GW: Inject Tool Definitions into Model Context
    end

    Note over LLM_GW,ExtLLM: 3. Upstream Model Invocation
    LLM_GW->>ExtLLM: Forward Request with Tool Definitions
    ExtLLM-->>LLM_GW: Return Tool Call Request (e.g., slack_post_message)

    Note over LLM_GW,CON_GW: 4. Bidirectional Tool Dispatch (Ctrl)
    LLM_GW->>Ctrl: Dispatch Tool Call (name, arguments)
    Ctrl->>CON_GW: Execute Tool (slack_post_message)
    CON_GW->>ACL: Check Connector Rule (e.g., Slack allowed, Office365 denied)
    CON_GW->>ExtSaaS: Invoke Slack API with User OAuth Token
    ExtSaaS-->>CON_GW: Tool Output (Message Sent)
    CON_GW-->>Ctrl: Tool Execution Result
    Ctrl-->>LLM_GW: Feed Tool Result back to LLM

    Note over LLM_GW,Dev: 5. Completion & GitOps Persistence
    LLM_GW->>ExtLLM: Send Tool Output for Final Synthesis
    ExtLLM-->>LLM_GW: Final Response Text
    LLM_GW-->>Dev: Stream Final Response
    par GitOps Audit
        Dev->>GitStore: Commit Session Snapshot & Checkpoint
        GitStore->>GitStore: Git Commit & Push (Local/Remote Git)
    end
```
